Upstream
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is a Go port of pptx-glimpse:

    pptx-glimpse  —  https://github.com/hirokisakabe/pptx-glimpse
    Copyright (c) 2026 hirokisakabe
    MIT License.
    Ported from upstream commit f18e8404126cfa3c3d334666c061a83c274ff6d4
    (2026-06-23, monorepo v1.1.1).

The architecture, module boundaries, behavior, naming, and test suite mirror
upstream; this port reimplements them in idiomatic Go. Sincere thanks to
hirokisakabe and the pptx-glimpse contributors — this project would not exist
without their work.

Test fixtures under `glimpse/testdata/shared-fixtures/` are taken from upstream
pptx-glimpse (MIT).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
resvg  —  https://github.com/linebender/resvg  (SVG → PNG rasterizer, pinned at
resvg 0.46). resvg and its dependency tree are under permissive licenses
(MIT / Apache-2.0 / BSD-3 / Zlib). The compiled resvg module is embedded
(`internal/resvg/wasm/resvg.wasm.gz`) for the default wazero backend and linked
as a static library for the optional native backend; see `resvg-wasm/` for the
build and the third-party license notices.
